{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 09:17-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.LOAN.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["lt"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["Nor\u0117dami i\u0161trinti, naudokite \u201eBackspace\u201c klavi\u0161\u0105."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["Rodykli\u0173 klavi\u0161ai \u012f kair\u0119, \u012f vir\u0161\u0173 ir \u012f apa\u010di\u0105 yra i\u0161jungti. Taip pat i\u0161jungti \u201eHome\u201c, \u201eEnd\u201c, \u201ePgUp\u201c ir \u201ePgDn\u201c klavi\u0161ai."],"Use backspace to delete.":["Naudokite \u201eBackspace\u201c, kad i\u0161trintum\u0117te."],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Jei pasirinkta reik\u0161m\u0117, tiesiog prad\u0117kite ra\u0161yti nauj\u0105 reik\u0161m\u0119, kad i\u0161trintum\u0117te ankstesn\u0119 reik\u0161m\u0119."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["Kai pasirinktas skai\u010dius (reik\u0161m\u0117 rodoma atvirk\u0161\u010diai), naudokite rodykl\u0117s \u012f de\u0161in\u0119 klavi\u0161\u0105, kad panaikintum\u0117te pasirinkim\u0105, bet nei\u0161valytum\u0117te reik\u0161m\u0117s. Tada backspace, kad gal\u0117tum\u0117te redaguoti."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["PATARIMAS: Paprastai norint pereiti nuo vieno \u012fvesties veiksmo prie kito ar ankstesnio, geriausia naudoti TAB arba SHIFT-TAB klavi\u0161us."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["2 PATARIMAS: Paprastai vert\u0117s redagavimas yra neveiksmingas. Kadangi reik\u0161m\u0117s pasirenkamos automati\u0161kai, tiesiog \u012fveskite norim\u0105 skai\u010di\u0173."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["Ne\u012fveskite t\u016bkstan\u010dio skiriamojo \u017eenklo."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Naudojant JAV konvencij\u0105, tai b\u016bt\u0173 kablelis.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["Esu pakankamai protingas, kad \u012fves\u010diau juos u\u017e jus!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["\u012evyko ne\u017einomos datos skai\u010diavimo klaida."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["Pateikite mums savo \u012fvestis ir nustatymus, kad gal\u0117tume tai i\u0161taisyti. A\u010di\u016b."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["Data negalioja - neteisingi metai."],"Jan":["Sau"],"Feb":["Vas"],"Mar":["Kov"],"Apr":["Bal"],"May":["gegu\u017e\u0117"],"Jun":["Bir"],"Jul":["Lie"],"Aug":["Rgp"],"Sept":["Rgs"],"Oct":["Spa"],"Nov":["Lap"],"Dec":["Gruod."],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Klaida: datos ne i\u0161 eil\u0117s."],"Exception":["I\u0161imtis"],"occurred when accessing":["\u012fvyko, kai buvo kreiptasi \u012f"],"Invalid index":["Netinkamas indeksas"],"Unknown":["Ne\u017einomas"],"u":["n"],"U":["N"],"Internal limit reached. Balance exceeds +\/- 99 trillion.":["Pasiekta vidin\u0117 riba. Balansas vir\u0161ija +\/- 99 trilijon\u0173."],"YTD":["Nuo met\u0173 prad\u017eios"],"Running Totals":["Kaupiamosios sumos"],"Normal":["\u012eprastas"],"Your Personalized Loan Schedule":["J\u016bs\u0173 asmeninis paskolos grafikas"],"Last payment amount decreased by":["Paskutin\u0117s \u012fmokos suma suma\u017einta per"],"due to rounding":["d\u0117l apvalinimo"],"Last payment amount increased by":["Paskutinio mok\u0117jimo suma padidinta"],"Loan Summary":["Paskolos santrauka"],"Loan Amount":["Paskolos suma"],"Number of Payments":["Mok\u0117jim\u0173 skai\u010dius"],"Annual Interest Rate":["Metin\u0117 pal\u016bkan\u0173 norma"],"Periodic Payment":["Periodinis mok\u0117jimas"],"Loan Date":["Paskolos data"],"1st Payment Due":["Pirmojo mok\u0117jimo terminas"],"Payment Frequency":["Mok\u0117jimo da\u017enumas"],"Last Payment Due":["Paskutinis mok\u0117jimo terminas"],"Total Interest Due":["I\u0161 viso mok\u0117tin\u0173 pal\u016bkan\u0173"],"Total All Payments":["Viso mok\u0117jim\u0173 suma"],"Payment Schedule":["Mok\u0117jim\u0173 grafikas"],"Year":["Metai"],"Date":["Data"],"Payment":["Mok\u0117jimas"],"Interest":["Pal\u016bkanos"],"Principal":["Pagrindin\u0117<br>suma"],"Balance":["Likutis"],"Calculation method: Normal":["Apskai\u010diavimo metodas: \u012eprastas"],"Total Principal":["Bendra pagrindin\u0117 suma"],"Total Interest":["Bendra pal\u016bkan\u0173 suma"],"Pct. of Total Payments":["Vis\u0173 mok\u0117jim\u0173 proc."],"Annual Principal and Interest Totals":["Bendra metin\u0117 pagrindin\u0117s sumos ir pal\u016bkan\u0173 suma"],"Accumulated Principal and Interest with Remaining Balance":["Sukaupta pagrindin\u0117 suma ir pal\u016bkanos su likusiu balansu"],"Total Principal and Interest":["I\u0161 viso pagrindin\u0117 suma ir pal\u016bkanos"],"Loan":["Paskola"],"There are too many unknown values.":["Yra per daug ne\u017einom\u0173 ver\u010di\u0173."],"Enter \"Loan Amount\", \"Number of Payments\" and \"Annual Interest Rate\".":["\u012eveskite \"Paskolos suma\", \"Mok\u0117jim\u0173 skai\u010dius\" ir \"Metin\u0117 pal\u016bkan\u0173 norma\"."],"<strong>Loan Calculator Help...<\/strong>":["<strong>Paskolos skai\u010diuokl\u0117 pagalba...<\/strong>"],"<p>Using the calculator is straightforward. User enters a &quot;loan amount&quot;, &quot;number of months&quot;, &quot;annual interest rate&quot;. The calculator calculates the monthly payment amount.<\/p>":["<p>Skai\u010diuokle naudotis paprasta. Vartotojas \u012fveda \u201epaskolos sum\u0105\u201c, \u201em\u0117nesi\u0173 skai\u010di\u0173\u201c, \u201emetin\u0119 pal\u016bkan\u0173 norm\u0105\u201c. Skai\u010diuokl\u0117 apskai\u010diuoja m\u0117nesin\u0119 \u012fmok\u0105.<\/p>"],"<p>The &quot;Payment Method&quot; determines when the first payment is due. With the default selection, &quot;End-of-Period&quot;, the first payment will be due one month after the loan is made. If &quot;Start-of-Period&quot; is selected, then the first payment will be due on the loan date.<\/p>":["<p>\u201emok\u0117jimo momentas\u201c nustato, kada yra pirmoji \u012fmoka. Su numatytuoju pasirinkimu \u201eLaikotarpio pabaiga\u201c pirmoji \u012fmoka bus po m\u0117nesio nuo paskolos suteikimo. Jei pasirenkama \u201eLaikotarpio prad\u017eia\u201c, pirmoji \u012fmoka bus paskolos suteikimo dien\u0105.<\/p>"],"<p class=\"tail\">The term (duration) of the loan is expressed as a number of months.<\/p>":["<p class=\"tail\">Paskolos terminas (trukm\u0117) i\u0161rei\u0161kiamas m\u0117nesi\u0173 skai\u010diumi.<\/p>"],"<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 months = &nbsp;5 years<\/li><li>120 months = 10 years<\/li><li>180 months = 15 years<\/li><li>240 months = 20 years<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 months = 30 years<\/li><\/ul>":["<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 m\u0117nesi\u0173 = &nbsp;5 metai<\/li><li>120 m\u0117nesi\u0173 = 10 met\u0173<\/li><li>180 m\u0117nesi\u0173 = 15 met\u0173<\/li><li>240 m\u0117nesi\u0173 = 20 met\u0173<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 m\u0117nesi\u0173 = 30 met\u0173<\/li><\/ul>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Set the dates? Set or change the payment and compounding frequencies? Print the schedule? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Reikia daugiau parink\u010di\u0173, \u012fskaitant galimyb\u0119 i\u0161spr\u0119sti kitas ne\u017einom\u0105sias? Nustatyti datas? Nustatyti arba pakeisti mok\u0117jim\u0173 ir kapitalizacijos da\u017enius? Atsispausdinti grafik\u0105? Eksportuoti \u012f MS Word&trade; (.docx) arba MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) failus? Apsilankykite, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["Datos turi b\u016bti pirm\u0105j\u0105 m\u0117nesio dien\u0105."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Neteisingas JavaScript datos objektas."],"Monthly":["m\u0117nesinis"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Set the dates? Set or change the payment and compounding frequencies? Print the charts? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Reikia daugiau parink\u010di\u0173, \u012fskaitant galimyb\u0119 i\u0161spr\u0119sti kitas ne\u017einom\u0105sias? Nustatyti datas? Nustatyti arba pakeisti mok\u0117jim\u0173 ir kapitalizacijos da\u017enius? Atsispausdinti diagramas? Eksportuoti \u012f MS Word&trade; (.docx) arba MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) failus? Apsilankykite, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Prepared for":["Vardas"],"Address":["Adresas"],"City, State  ZIP":["Miestas, valstija, pa\u0161to kodas"],"Prepared On":["Parengimo data"],"Prepared by":["Pareng\u0117"],"Phone":["Telefonas"],"Email":["El. pa\u0161tas"],"Website":["Svetain\u0117"]}}}